               <span  style="color:red;">Academic Infrastructure</span><br><br>
               <span  style="color:blue;">Library :</span> <br>
               The University has a well stocked Library of Courseware, Books & References. For latest updates, the Library is equipped with journals and magazines.<br><br>
               <span  style="color:blue;">Computer Facilities :</span><br>
               State-of-the-art infrastructure at computer lab with latest Intel-based computing facility is provided at both the Campuses. The computers are connected over Local Area Network (LAN) in hybrid fashion with enough internet bandwidth for general use, especially for online training, research, video conferencing, etc.<br><br>
               <span  style="color:blue;">Laboratories :</span> <br>
               The University has equipped itself with a Computer Lab along with internet facilities.<br><br>
               <span  style="color:red;">Other Infrastructure</span>  <br><br>
               <span  style="color:blue;">Placement Cell : </span><br>
               The Placement Cell comprising of the Faculty Members looks after the Placement and the Summer Internship Programme of the Students.<br><br>
               <span  style="color:blue;">Recreational Facilities :</span><br>
               Indoor recreational facilities are available for students. 
